    {
      "address": "0x3858",
      "comment": "THE MELODY DRIVER (a.k.a. func_music_driver). Per-VBlank-frame tick, invoked from func_vblank_isr (RST 7 @0x0038) via the ISR trampoline that copies CALL func_music_tick to 0x03F8. Reads data_music_scores(0x3E1A) header (duration=scores+2=6 ticks, loop lens=scores+6/7/8=96). Manages tick counter var_music_tick(0x383A) and per-voice step indices var_music_ptr_01/02/03(0x383B/C/D): when tick wraps, wraps each index at its loop length, CALLs func_music_process_voice(0x3946) to look up the three periods (from data_music_period_table) into data_voice_param_buf, then CALLs func_music_play_note_ch0(0x3BCA)/ch1(0x3C7D) each frame to emit + vibrato. Outputs to KR580VI53 tone generator ch0/ch1/ch2. Drives the 3-channel title melody.",
      "links": [
        "0x3854",
