    },
    {
      "address": "0x3940",
      "comment": "Обёртка звуковой операции: PUSH PSW; CALL func_sound_op(0x01BC); POP PSW; RET. Вызывает 16-позиционный диспетчер звука VI53, сохраняя A между вызовом (индекс операции в A, значение в E).",
      "links": [
        "0x01BC"
      ],
      "name": "func_snd_op_keep_a",
      "properties": {
        "params": "in: A=op_index, E=value (forwarded to func_sound_op); out: A preserved (PSW pushed/popped). Thin wrapper."
      },
      "size": 6,
      "type": "function"
    },
    {
      "address": "0x3946",
      "comment": "Stage11: Reads current note code for each of 3 voices from stream (var_music_stream_base_NN + var_music_ptr_NN). If code==0 -> rest (clears buf slot). Else computes period = data_music_period_table[ (scores+1 BASE=6) + code ] via index=2*(6+code), stores 16-bit LE into data_voice_param_buf slots: ch0->buf[0..1], ch1->buf[2..3], ch2->buf[4..5]. Also permutes score header bytes (scores +0/+3/+4/+5/+9/+A/+B/+C) into buf[14/8/9/10/6/11/12/13] (gate/envelope/control ops). ch2 code bit7 -> func_music_set_note_params(0x3B0F). Ends with CALL func_music_load_voice_params(0x3902) which emits buf[0..13] as sound-op codes 0..13 (+buf[14] as op7) through func_sound_op -> VI53 ports.",
