      "comment": "Stage11: Despite prior name, this is the working copy of the voice-0 (ch0) current note byte (bit7 = reserved on ch0; low 7 bits = note code), stored by func_music_process_voice @0x39DE; read by func_music_play_note_ch0 (LDA 3BC8). var at 0x3BC9 = same for voice-1/ch1.",
