      "comment": "Stage11: Per-tick voice-0 (ch0) sounding routine. Does NOT set base pitch (that is done once per step by func_music_process_voice into data_voice_param_buf). Each frame reads row selector scores[+0x0D], indexes data_music_vibrato_table[(row-1)*20 + tick], adds to buf[0], and emits through func_snd_op_keep_a2 -> func_sound_op op0 -> KR580VI53 ch0 (port 0Bh). So it re-asserts ch0 with vibrato every VBlank while the step lasts (6 frames).",
